cial documents only. Because this image was rejected, \n48:               <strong>all financial figures have been left empty</strong> to prevent hallucinating incorrect numbers into your accounting books.\n49:             </p>\n50:             <div class=\"pt-2 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono\">\n51:               <span class=\"bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">is_valid_bill: false</span>\n52:               <span class=\"bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">subtotal: null</span>\n53:               <span class=\"bg-slate-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded\">total_declared: null</span>\n54:             </div>\n55:           </div>\n56: \n57:           <div class=\"pt-2 flex items-center space-x-2\">\n58:             <button id=\"btn-back-dashboard-reject\" class=\"px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white text-xs font-bold shadow transition-all active:scale-95\">\n59:               ← Upload a Genuine Bill\n60:             </button>\n61:           </div>\n62:         </div>\n63:       </div>\n64:     `;\n65: \n66:     const btnBackReject = container.querySelector(\"#btn-back-dashboard-reject\");\n67:     if (btnBackReject && onBack) {\n68:       btnBackReject.addEventListener(\"click\", onBack);\n69:     }\n70:     return;\n71:   }\n72: \n73:   const isOvercharge = audit.hasTotalDiscrepancy;\n74:   const isClean = audit.status === \"VERIFIED\";\n75:   const isWarning = audit.status === \"REVIEW_NEEDED\";\n76: \n77:   const { audit_summary, calculated_tax, ai_suggestions } = taxData || {\n78:     audit_summary: {\n79:       total_turnover: 3600000,\n80:       deemed_profit: 244800,\n81:       eligible_itc: audit.gstinValid ? audit.totalTax : 0,\n82:       disallowed_itc: !audit.gstinValid ? audit.totalTax : 0,\n83:       invoices_missing_gstin: audit.gstinValid ? 0 : 1,\n84:       digital_ratio: 0.60\n85:     },"}
{"step_index":264,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T16:30:39Z","input_tokens":2669,"cache_read_tokens":220653,"output_tokens":5416,"thinking":"The code checks for an invalid bill and then whether the audit is halted. If halted, a confirmation prompt should be rendered. This section is being crafted to precisely handle cases with missing or unclear inputs by halting the calculation and displaying a halt banner.\n\n\nThe halt banner clearly indicates an issue with missing or unclear input fields. The calculation is paused to avoid inaccuracies. The system will prompt the user to review and enter the valid numbers from the bill to ensure accurate tax calculations.\n\n\nThe system identifies missing input fields. A form is generated to prompt the user for the missing values, including descriptions. Numerical fields are specified with appropriate input types and validation attributes. A \"mark as unregistered\" option is provided for GSTIN fields.\n\n\nForm fields are dynamically generated based on missing input data. Each field includes 